# Space / Tab / Shift+Tab cycle through the boards that need a move (Mandatory first), each focused at zoom >= 0.8; Home is the Overview.
# Misc - Time Line Battle: three 5x5 boards (timelines 0, 1 and 2), White must move on all three.
# Layout (1400x800): Versus (150,250); row 7 of the mode list (690,604); Play (808,712).
wait 20
click 150 250        # Versus
wait 30
click 690 604        # Misc - Time Line Battle (row 7)
wait 20
click 808 712        # Play
wait 120
camexpect state Overview
camexpect zoom 0.4 0.7
capture camera-space-overview
key SPACE            # the first board that needs a move: timeline 0
wait 40
camexpect state Focus
camexpect zoom 0.79 2.0
camexpect visible 0 0
capture camera-space-first
key SPACE            # timeline 1
wait 40
camexpect visible 1 0
capture camera-space-second
key SPACE            # timeline 2
wait 40
camexpect visible 2 0
capture camera-space-third
key SPACE            # wraps round to timeline 0
wait 40
camexpect visible 0 0
key SHIFT_TAB        # backwards: timeline 2
wait 40
camexpect visible 2 0
capture camera-space-backwards
key TAB              # forwards again
wait 40
camexpect visible 0 0
key HOME
wait 40
camexpect state Overview
capture camera-space-home
